# node_modules is deliberately NOT excluded here - the Dockerfile COPYs it in as-is
# (build.sh, run by the platform before Dockerfile builds, is what actually produces
# it - see Dockerfile's own header). Excluding it would break the build; this used to
# be excluded back when the Dockerfile ran its own npm ci internally, before the
# build.sh/Dockerfile split.
test
.git
.tekton
k8s
*.md
